{
  "$description": "Quarter Turn brand tokens (W3C DTCG). The prose in colors.md/typography.md/visual.md is the human truth; this is its compiled form. Regenerate dist/web/tokens.css with `node ~/builder/bin/build-tokens.mjs .`. NOTE: this app is dark-only by construction -- the six cube face colors are calibrated against a zero-luminance background and would need re-deriving on a light surface. Every color therefore carries an IDENTICAL builder.dark value, so the app can hard-set <html data-theme=\"dark\"> and an accidental light render is still correct rather than broken. See colors.md -> Light mode.",
